{"productId": "5e7a6293-bf93-40b6-96d7-06222ab44193", "modelName": "One Shot Sled", "modelDescription": "The One Shot Sled is for the Glenfield Model A Rifle. The polymer flush-fit sled allows only a single round to be loaded into the rifle and provides smooth, single-round feeding. When inserted in the rifle, the One-Shot sled fits flush with the stock and does not interfere when carrying a slung rifle or shooting from a bag or backpack. The sled is installed in place of a magazine and is compatible with short-action rifles in several calibers- 350 Legend, 450 Bushmaster, 308 Win, 243 Win and 6.5mm Creedmoor. This package includes the following components: sled, magazine well, two action screws and a 3/16\" Allen wrench. Made in the USA.", "manufacturerName": "Glenfield Firearms", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": false, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "1aceef6f-929b-4a93-adfe-da44e26d61ea", "description": "Glenfield, Singl Shot Sled, Model A Short Action, 1 Round, 6.5 Creedmoor/308 Win/450 Bushmaster/243 Win/350 Legend, Black Polymer", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/a9fd124d-e8fe-4ea7-9f92-0ed0996653a4"], "isDefault": true, "manufacturerPartNumber": "90805", "upc": "736676908059", "attributes": [{"attributeNameId": "7f2d6a5a-7407-4a8d-b6af-f65a9dfc1586", "attributeName": "Capacity", "attributeValueId": "9f7af101-e128-4d3c-bcc3-bc75c5a8814a", "valueName": "1 Round"}, {"attributeNameId": "615ff930-af4a-4f0b-b66f-049ece1eb14c", "attributeName": "Color", "attributeValueId": "a79fb5d4-5ce2-4664-bd2d-c2be679d233d", "valueName": "Black"}, {"attributeNameId": "c6dbbafd-0a19-44e3-a6d4-33cf77367bf2", "attributeName": "High Capacity", "attributeValueId": "76a11bbd-759b-4453-a9be-3f7e818ddf68", "valueName": "No"}, {"attributeNameId": "623bab4f-5eb0-4048-92db-8200b6ce663d", "attributeName": "Caliber", "attributeValueId": "92f9fc85-9f8b-4482-8c84-6325a0dd5859", "valueName": "308 Winchester"}, {"attributeNameId": "a6c6afd5-6199-4177-8b82-f0c172545f6